#: shelley_shelf/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "SHELF"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Hey there cutie!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "How's it hangin' buddy?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Ugh, not you!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HI HI HI!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/6
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You got big 'I have a question' vibes right now..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm here looking for Davi - have you seen him?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "No... but maybe that explains that weird noise the other day."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I was helpin' Stepford get his lift on' and it was goin' great..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But then we started hearing these WEIRD noises from the closet."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'm not gonna lie, I was REAL SCARED BUDDY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But Stepford was even more scared!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "So I just yelled the fear right out of him and then we finished our set."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/58
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It's hard being brave for your friends, but I couldn't let him suffer!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/66
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You need me to yell the fear outta you too?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/74/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good, but thanks. That's all I needed."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/74/c-0/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Cool, cool. Anytime you need a little cheering up I'll be here!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_inanimals/0/c-0/74/c-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Come back real soon, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A well-muscled athlete stands before you, shifting restlessly from one foot to the other."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a strange air of anxiety to her despite the broad smile plastered on her face—she seems a little <i>too</i> happy to see you."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/22/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HEYYYYY! What is UP dude!? How are you?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/23/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HEYYYYY! What is UP dudette!? How are you?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/24/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HEYYYYY! What is UP pal!? How are you?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm alright I guess."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am SO good my dude."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HUH? Why do you think I'm not!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Do I seem not okay!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'm SO OKAY I promise!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Aww man, just alright?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "We can do better than alright!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "We gotta get you to AMAZING!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-2/7/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HELL YEAH BROSEFINO! THAT'S WHAT I'M TRYIN' TO HEAR!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-2/8/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HELL YEAH BROSEFINA! THAT'S WHAT I'M TRYIN' TO HEAR!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/c-2/9/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HELL YEAH BROSEFINX! THAT'S WHAT I'M TRYIN' TO HEAR!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, I can't believe we're like, actually talking now dude."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I can't believe we're like, actually talking now dudette."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, I can't believe we're like, actually talking now pal."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You've walked past me a thousand times and never even looked at me, but that's totally okay!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "After all, I don't do this for the recognition!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'm just a humble shelf tryin' to grab life by the horns!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/29
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Gotta carpe that diem if you know what I'm sayin'!!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/37
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Aww DRYWALL, I almost forgot to tell you my name!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Slow down and take a breath."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry... just been busy..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go on then."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M BREATHIN' JUST FINE, MY GUY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-3/8/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M BREATHIN' JUST FINE, MY GAL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-3/9/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M BREATHIN' JUST FINE, BUDDY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Of course you were! Like the other day when you spent 7 hours on the couch looking at your phone!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-4/15/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You must have been CRAZY busy!!! I totally get it, brodude!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-4/16/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, you must have been CRAZY busy!!! I totally get it, brodudette!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-4/17/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You must have been CRAZY busy!!! I totally get it, brozone!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Okay okay okay here I go!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "The name's Shelley! I'm your shelves!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/14
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It's my JOB to hold your stuff up with my amazing muscles!!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/22
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I REALLY ENJOY DOING IT!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why does it feel like you're trying to convince me you like it?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I can tell by the way you're yelling."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's really great to hear."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "DO YOU NOT BELIEVE ME?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "IT'S JUST MY ENTIRE PURPOSE I LOVE IT I PROMISE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "YELLING IS THE UNIVERSAL LANGUAGE OF JOY MY DUDE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-7/8/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "YELLING IS THE UNIVERSAL LANGUAGE OF JOY MY DAME!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-7/9/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "YELLING IS THE UNIVERSAL LANGUAGE OF JOY MY PAL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-8/7/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "GREAT! TRULY GLAD TO HEAR IT BROMIGO!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-8/8/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "GREAT! TRULY GLAD TO HEAR IT BROMIGA!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-1/c-8/9/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "GREAT! TRULY GLAD TO HEAR IT BROMIE G!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Anyway it's REALLY great to hear from you!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "This experience is <i>100%</i> aligning with my years-long fantasy of meeting you!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'VE NEVER TRULY BEEN HAPPIER!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you upset with me?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did you think I was gonna be cooler?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I kinda thought shelves would be a little bit chiller."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Ohmygosh, NO! NEVER! NOT YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "OH NO, YOU'RE AMAZING! 10/10 HUMAN BEING!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "AM I NOT CHILL?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "COME ON SHELLEY, DON'T FUCK THIS UP!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "THIS IS GOING REALLY GREAT ACTUALLY, NOT A DISASTER!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M JUST GONNA GO FOR A COMPLETELY UNRELATED REASON!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-3/16/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "LATER DUDERINO!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-3/17/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "LATER DUDERINA!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_intro/0/g-3/18/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "LATER DUDELY DOO!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley's endless energy doesn't seem to have lessened any today. When you see her, she's clutching a duster a bit too tightly."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/14
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh my god, look who it is!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/22
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I was just thinking about you and here you are!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/30
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I mean, I thought about you all night after you left and it didn't make you show up then but like-"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/38
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "IT DEFINITELY WORKED THIS TIME!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You thought about me all night?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What a coincidence, I thought about you all night too."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem a little tense."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You're probably thinking I sound like a major creep!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-0/18/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But I assure you it was all nothing but the most positive thoughts you can imagine, dude!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-0/19/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But I assure you it was all nothing but the most positive thoughts you can imagine, dudette!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-0/20/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But I assure you it was all nothing but the most positive thoughts you can imagine, pal!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HUH?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "YOU WEREN'T MAD AT ME, WERE YOU?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "CAUSE IT'S ALL LOVE OVER HERE, BUD!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'VE NEVER BEEN MORE RELAXED IN MY LIFE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's still holding the feather duster so tightly you worry it may snap—a distinct possibility with all that muscle."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's with the feather duster?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Were you doing some cleaning?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, careful not to break that thing."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, this old thing!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I was just... uh..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Me!? Oh God, uh..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I AM BEING CAREFUL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I mean, ah, I'm just seizing the duster, you know what I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Hey, so like, I know you've been reeeeal busy with all the... things you've been up to lately."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Like sitting on the couch... sitting at the computer... taking naps..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But since you haven't really been looking at me, like, ever, it makes sense you might not have noticed I'm dusty."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I mean, like, I'M cool with it—dust is great! It's so... powdery!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But it's making me sneeze and that makes it a LOT harder to hang onto these walls, so..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Maybe we could like live to the fullest and dust me?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley thrusts the feather duster out towards you, withdrawing her hand so swiftly you nearly let the duster fall."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your humble feather duster—you've never been all that big on dusting, but this thing does get the job done."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley has her eyes shut tightly as she waits for you to dust her—she looks oddly nervous."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/75/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you actually want me to do this?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/76/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why do you look scared?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/77/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there a problem?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WHY WOULDN'T I?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M NOT SCARED!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "NONE AT ALL! Heheh..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/0/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "OH, I'VE NEVER WANTED ANYTHING LIKE I WANT THIS DUSTING, BRODERINO!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/1/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'VE NEVER WANTED ANYTHING LIKE I WANT THIS DUSTING, BRODERINA!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/2/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'VE NEVER WANTED ANYTHING LIKE I WANT THIS DUSTING, BRODIE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley's reassurances aren't all that convincing, but you suppose a little dusting never hurt anybody."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Dust fast and furious.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Dust gently.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Dust thoroughly.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The moment the duster makes contact with Shelley she screams, twisting away from it."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "NOT SO HARD! YOU WANT ME TO FALL?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/35
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I MEAN... ah... hey, take 'er easy pal!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/43
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You gotta do it real soft-like!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She takes your hand in hers and guides it, though the gesture is anything but romantic. She speaks through gritted teeth."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/59
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Like. This. See?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-9/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You follow Shelley's weirdly tense instructions, cleaning her thoroughly."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-10/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley winces when the duster makes contact with her. Fortunately over time, your gentle touch allows her to relax—though with Shelley, relax seems to be a relative term."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-10/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eventually you get her clean, though it does take a little while."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-11/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley winces when the duster makes contact with her, and once or twice she looks as if she wants to complain."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-2/5/c-11/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But eventually she relaxes under the duster's touch, and she actually seems pretty pleased with your work."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You try to hand the duster back to her, but she shakes her head."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You keep it."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Wow, look at us, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You actually talked to me, and now you've actually cleaned me!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/35
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Our relationship is deepening already!!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/43
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You're not gonna leave now, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I kinda thought dusting you would make you less..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you so nervous about?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd never do that!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-12/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Less what?! LESS WHAT?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-12/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "LESS DUSTY!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-12/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'm gonna go with less dusty!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-13/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M NOT NERVOUS!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-13/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I DON'T SPEND EVERY WAKING MOMENT GRIPPED BY THE FEAR OF FAILURE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-13/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I THINK POSITIVE THOUGHTS AROUND THE CLOCK!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-4/c-14/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh good. GOOD!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Look, buddy... pal... booboobear..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You're a human being and not a shelf so like, I don't know if you can understand the kinda stuff I deal with."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "And that's okay! Nobody understands the pressure of being a shelf!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Personally I LOVE being so unique that nobody gets me!!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Imagine if I was one of those people who had tons of friends who supported them!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/40
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Pshh, where would I be then?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Supported, probably?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Happier?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not here annoying me, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/c-15/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh you'd THINK so, wouldn't you!? That's how they get ya!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/c-16/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Happier!? HARDLY!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/c-17/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "DON'T BE SO SURE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-5/c-17/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "ALSO HEY, OUCH!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You think just cause people believe in me and support me I'd suddenly shake off the fear of falling!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WOW!! I'D LIKE TO GET A TASTE OF SOME OF THAT POSITIVE THINKING FOR MYSELF!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Tell you what, pal!! Why don't I show you just what kinda life I live."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Next time you come back I'll give you a day in the life of a shelf."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "And then you can see just how and why I maintain such an impressively sunny and positive outlook!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do I have any choice?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You call that 'impressively sunny and positive'?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/c-18/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WE ALWAYS HAVE A CHOICE, BUCKO!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/c-18/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I hope you'll choose the BEST AND RIGHT AND MOST POSITIVE THING!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/c-19/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "IT TOTALLY IS!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-6/c-20/7 shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "GREAT!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction1/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "SEE YOU NEXT TIME PAL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley is pacing when you come upon her—when she spots you, she startles."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/14
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HEY HEY HEY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She bounds over to you, arms wide open for a hug."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Embrace her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "OH MY GOD, WHAT'S THAT OVER THERE!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Duck.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley's embrace is absolutely crushing—but it's not just her raw power that makes you feel smothered."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's a desperation in her grip that makes you feel like you've entered a place you can never escape."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The hug seems to last an eternity, Shelley's fingers sinking into your soft skin with a bruising force."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She releases you eventually, but you're certain you'll be sore later."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You point somewhere behind Shelley, and she whirls around."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WHAT!? WHAT IS IT?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-1/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she sees nothing she turns back, but her normally nervous smile is now even more tense."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-1/40
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I didn't see anything... but thanks for looking out, my pal!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Somehow Shelley has anticipated this movement, and she ducks right along with you, scooping you into her arms in a crushing embrace."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Despite your struggles, Shelley only holds you tighter, shushing you in a manner you assume she believes is soothing."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-2/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Ugh don't worry, friendo! I got you... I got you!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/c-2/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're almost panting by the time she lets go of you—it was starting to get hard to breathe."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Alright, you're really gonna love this."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I stayed up all night thinking about how to explain what I go through in terms you'd easily understand!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I borrowed a bunch of weights from Dunk to show you!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "He was so excited to help me he practically threw them at me!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "If I wasn't as strong and positive as I am my feelings mighta been real hurt!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "IT'S FINE THOUGH! He just wanted to help!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do people throw things at you a lot?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really respect your constant positivity."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He definitely just wanted you to leave."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "All the time actually!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It's probably cause I'm so good at staying on the wall even under pressure!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "BUT A WEAKER SHELF THAN ME MIGHT START TO WONDER YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-4/13/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Thanks bro!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-4/14/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Thanks sis!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-4/15/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, thanks buddy!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It ain't easy keepin' it up in the face of the world's negativity!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-4/26
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "BUT ME, I'M AN ENDLESS RAY OF SUNSHINE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That's exactly what somebody with a weak mindset would say!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Not us though! POSITIVE THINKING PALS!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Alright, so here's what we're gonna do."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I got this yoga mat right here... if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Get on your hands and knees."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, hot."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not doing that."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I KNOW IT SOUNDS LIKE SOME WEIRD KINK THING, BUT I PROMISE IT'S TOTALLY NORMAL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/c-6/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I WON'T BE STARING AT YOUR CAN, I SWEAR!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HEY, I'M GLAD YOU THINK SO BUT THAT'S NOT THE POINT, I PROMISE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "PLEASE DO BECAUSE I WOULD HATE TO HAVE BROUGHT THESE WEIGHTS HERE FOR NO REASON!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley is so emphatic it would probably be faster to just let her do whatever silly thing she's planning to do... so you decide to give in."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley waits patiently for you to lower yourself to the ground—or about as patiently as she can manage."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You humor her, settling on your hands and knees on the yoga mat Shelley has brought for you."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Okay. Great. Excellent. Now the weights..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "One by one, Shelley begins to carefully arrange weights across your back."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They're heavy and precariously placed—one wrong move would send them tumbling to the floor."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Alright, how are you feeling?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stupid."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Scared shitless."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A little nervous."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "NO! NOT THAT!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/c-9/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "What you SHOULD be feeling is scared!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It is real scary, isn't it!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Only a little?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You should be feeling SCARED!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It's a lot of pressure to hold things up! BUT WAIT, THERE'S MORE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley grabs ahold of the yoga mat with both hands, jerking it suddenly from side to side."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The effect is not unlike a mini earthquake."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's all you can do to hold onto the yoga mat, your knuckles turning white with the effort."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/38
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HOW DO WE FEEL NOW?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "STRESSED!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "SCARED!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "ANGRY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "BINGO!!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WELL YEAH BUT MORE THAN THAT... IT'S STRESS, BABY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "NO NO! TOO NEGATIVE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-3/c-14/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "YOU'RE SUPPOSED TO FEEL THE STRESS!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/3
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "IMAGINE HAVING TO HOLD STUFF UP AND YOU DON'T EVEN HAVE THE PROPER FOUNDATION!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "DAY IN AND DAY OUT YOU GOTTA CLING TO A WALL NOT KNOWIN' WHETHER TODAY'S THE DAY YOU FALL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley taps her forehead, switching swiftly from stress to a knowing smirk."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That's why I gotta be so positive all the time!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/35
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Positivity won't keep stuff from fallin' but it WILL help my fingers dig just that much harder into the drywall!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I get up now?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, what can't positivity achieve?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must be really strong."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "OH, SHIT MY BAD MY BAD!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M SAYIN'!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/c-16/21 shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/c-17/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Okay okay, time to reset!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-4/c-17/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HECK! I am... but positivity is the real reason I'm so strong!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley frantically clears the weights from your back, helping you stand up again."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Thanks for seein' things from my perspective!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Nobody else ever wants to listen long enough to get what I'm talkin' about!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It's always \"Not now, Shelley\", and \"please stop yelling at me, Shelley!\" and \"Please leave before I have you escorted out, Shelley!\""
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-5/35
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I gotta take these back to Dunk now before he needs 'em again—but it was real nice talkin' shelf with you!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction2/0/g-5/43
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "CATCH YOU ON THE FLIPSIDE MY PAL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/10/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WHATTUP MY DUDE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WHATTUP MY DUDETTE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/12/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "WHATTUP MY PAL!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh, I can't believe you're back after the last time!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/23
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That little negative voice in the back of my head was really sure you'd never come back after that whole weights thing we did!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/31
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "BUT I WRESTLED IT INTO SUBMISSION WITH THE POWER OF POSITIVE THINKING!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/39
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I DIDN'T SPEND THE ENTIRE NIGHT SWEATING AND CRYING!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It worries me when you say things like that."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please don't stress yourself out on my behalf."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, sounds like someone wasn't thinking positive enough."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Huh?! WHY?!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I told ya I DIDN'T spend all night feeling sad and scared!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That's a thing that very definitely didn't happen!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh no, I'd never!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I mean, I would, if that was what you wanted... but you don't, right? RIGHT?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "S-SO I DIDN'T!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I CAN BE MORE POSITIVE, JUST GIMME A CHANCE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'LL SHOW YOU I PROMISE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For the first time since you've met Shelley, you're interrupted by the presence of another."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... you have visitor, Shelley."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, my friend is here, and it looks like busy time."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Darling! I did not expect to see you here with shelf. It appears I have interrupted."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/17/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hmph. The human speaks with the shelf."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/20
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will return another time..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For the love of god please stay."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't mind."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, you're so popular Shelley."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You almost sound like you don't wanna be alone with me!!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But I'm sure that's not what you meant!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "HAHAHA! I GUESS I AM RIGHT NOW, AREN'T I!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... well then..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will keep it short."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/16/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "First, greetings to the human. I am Dasha. I am desk."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Shelley... your constant anxiety is creating atmosphere of tension in the house."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Everyone is afraid to hurt your feelings... so I have come to have talk with you."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...you're not here to hang out with me?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is business call."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/51 shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...oh."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley's eyes fill with tears, but where you would expect her to have an outsized reaction, she only looks down at the ground."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This looks like real hurt."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/78/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well it looks like you hurt her feelings anyway."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/79/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So that's how you get her to stop talking."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you think you could have said that a bit nicer?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am not intending to!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hey. You are not helping the situation."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...perhaps. I apologize, Shelley."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It was not my intention to hurt you."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We care about your feelings Shelley. Really."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But we have tried dancing around it for long enough."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you could give her some advice on relaxing?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There must be something you can do to help her chill out."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't you like give her the secret desk cheat code to stability?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... w-well..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I do not know if there is much I can do..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is no such thing as a desk cheat code."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What can I tell you but to relax?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You must trust in your muscles. They are considerable!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley sniffles, finally speaking."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Easy for you to say."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Nobody put you together wrong."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You can just trust you're gonna do your job every day."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean 'put you together wrong'?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shelley... are you improperly mounted?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-3/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Tears stream down Shelley's cheeks—Dasha gives Shelley a sweet, if awkward pat on the shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/14
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am sorry, Shelley. Please... try just to relax a bit, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We are all on your side, even if you do not feel it every moment."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will let the two of you speak."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/41
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley sniffles again."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/49
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Yeah. I'm mounted wrong."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/57
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "No studs. No anchors. Right into the drywall."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/65
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Why do you think I'm so strong? I've had to hold on like crazy for years and years."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/73
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Dasha and Abel and all the rest of those guys... they don't know what it's like."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/84
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "They can just rely on their own muscles to get the job done, knowing nothin's wrong."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/92
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Me... I just gotta know one of these days I'm gonna fall."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/100
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Someone's gonna put too much weight on me and I'm gonna rip right out of the wall."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/108
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Whoever I'm holding up's gonna break and I'm gonna know it was all my fault."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/116/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't we just remount you properly?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/117/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't it the fault of whoever installed you?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/118/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't be so negative."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You think I didn't think of that before?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That's nice of you to say... but it's a shelf's responsibility to care for whoever she's holdin' up!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "LET ME BE NEGATIVE ONCE!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/c-17/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'M POSITIVE EVERY MINUTE OF THE DAY!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-4/c-17/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She exhales loudly, trying to shake it off."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I tried askin' around the house years ago if anybody could fix me..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Nobody but Tony was even willing to try... and I am NOT letting that guy near me!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/19
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You're the only person I'd trust to even try."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm... really not handy."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't even know where I'd begin."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is not my problem."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "So you're saying... you'd probably make it worse."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/c-19/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Oh... I see."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/c-20/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Yeah... heh... yeah."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-5/c-20/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It's mine."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...guess it was stupid to think I could fix it."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That's fine. Guess that's enough negativity for now."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Just gotta... be positive."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's clear Shelley's heart is not in her affirmations."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe there's a middle ground here."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if you just accepted the possibility of falling?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. Be positive."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-21/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "What, like... just be scared and not so loud about it?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-21/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...I guess that could... work."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "How can I accept that!?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's something I've had to deal with all my life."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It takes some time... you might be working on it your entire life."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's for you to sort out."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But you seem so cool."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...maybe someday, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "... I don't know if I can."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Guess I have some time to figure it out."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-22/21/c-2/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-6/c-23/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Yeah. That's what I do best."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'm gonna go... think."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_interaction3/0/g-7/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley walks off away from you without looking back—you've never seen her so quiet or down."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Hey... duderino."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Hey... brosefina."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Hey... brodie."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/5
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley still has a slight air of nervousness to her, but the edge in her voice is gone."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/13
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "So I was doin' a lot of thinking..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/21
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "And some reading up online."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/29
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I thought always bein' positive would help the negativity and fear I felt..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/37
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But I guess that's what folks call 'toxic' positivity."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/45
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "And that's bad!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/53
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I was just so scared of falling down and letting everybody down..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/61
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I was pushin' people away without even meaning to!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You were really intense."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't blame you considering your situation."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was a lot."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I was! It's... really embarrassing honestly."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Well... thanks, but..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "It was the wrong way to go."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I know... and I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I'm still scared of falling down, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I don't really know what to do with all that fear."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Learning to deal with it can be a lifelong struggle."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You just learn to live with it."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just try not to think about it."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Yeah... and maybe... maybe that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Maybe someday I will too."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "That's what I used to do and it didn't work."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I have to just... accept it."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "But look. I gotta thank you."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "Most everybody runs away from me before too long."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "You stuck around... and you were supportive."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I don't know if I'd have ever been able to relax long enough to rethink my entire deal without you around."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "In a way... you were my shelf."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "So thanks."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-1/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's a weird way to put it, but thanks."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "There's um... one more thing."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I haven't been close to anybody in a long time. And you've been on my mind... so much."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I thought it was all the anxiety at first..."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_loveending/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Shelley"
