msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "...and the books they hold help other people find their happiness!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_love_join/32
msgctxt "Shelley"
msgid "I GOTTA BE A PART OF THIS!"
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_love_join/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Shelley becomes known around town as the Swole Librarian, or the Swolebrarian, using her impressive muscles to stock books with ease and point patrons in the direction of their desired titles."
msgstr ""

#: shelley_shelf/shelley_love_join/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She still wrestles with the fear of failure from time to time, but the scent of books and the silent strength of the library bookshelves always reassure her."
msgstr ""
